# ─── Data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The thesis keeps raw/processed data out of version control (dated
# snapshots + NAS/cloud backup instead). Track code, docs and configs
# only. Force-add a specific small file with `git add -f` if ever needed.
/data/

